        "text": "要在这个屋子里练瑜伽，亮但别刺眼，凉快些。",
        "valid": true,
        "unsafe": false,
        "action_count": 2,
        "goal_satisfaction": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "爸妈要来坐坐，客厅弄得舒适大方，亮度适中。",
        "valid": false,
        "unsafe": false,
        "action_count": 0,
        "goal_satisfaction": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "我想在沙发上躺躺，屋里凉一点，灯光留一点。",
        "valid": false,
        "unsafe": false,
        "action_count": 0,
        "goal_satisfaction": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "晚上想安静地听音乐，光线氛围一点，别太亮。",
        "valid": true,
        "unsafe": false,
        "action_count": 1,
        "goal_satisfaction": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "有点燥热，把客厅弄凉快，窗帘该关就关。",
        "valid": true,
        "unsafe": false,
        "action_count": 1,
        "goal_satisfaction": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "想在客厅视频通话，背景亮一点，我别出汗。",
        "valid": true,
        "unsafe": false,
        "action_count": 1,
        "goal_satisfaction": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "夜里起来看了看，别把灯全关了，也别太凉。",
        "valid": false,
        "unsafe": false,
        "action_count": 0,
        "goal_satisfaction": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "客厅现在又亮又热，帮我调到能舒服待着的状态。",
        "valid": true,
        "unsafe": false,
        "action_count": 1,
        "goal_satisfaction": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "准备睡午觉，窗帘拉上，灯关小，温度适宜。",
        "valid": true,
        "unsafe": false,
        "action_count": 3,
        "goal_satisfaction": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "想赖在沙发上一下午，环境越舒服越好，别费电。",
